### ==============================================================================
### DroolsStatefulController: Shopping Cart, Quantity Rules & Fact Insertion
### Demonstrates: Stateful KieSession, Working Memory reactivity (update()),
###               Dynamic FreeGift fact insertion, Working Memory queries,
###               and explicit session disposal.
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. High-Value Electronics Cart: Category Discount + Free Earbuds
# 3 Keyboards @ $100 = $300. Electronics bulk discount: -$60 ($20/unit).
# Final total = $240 (>= $200 threshold) -> Triggers dynamic insertion of Free Earbuds!
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drools/stateful/cart-evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "cartId": "CART-501",
  "customerId": "CUST-A",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PROD-KB",
      "productName": "RGB Mechanical Keyboard",
      "category": "ELECTRONICS",
      "unitPrice": 100.0,
      "quantity": 3
    }
  ]
}

###

### 2. Super Cart: Exceeds $500 -> Triggers BOTH Free Earbuds AND 20k mAh Powerbank!
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drools/stateful/cart-evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "cartId": "CART-502",
  "customerId": "CUST-B",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PROD-MONITOR",
      "productName": "4K Ultra-Wide Curved Monitor",
      "category": "ELECTRONICS",
      "unitPrice": 650.0,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

###

### 3. Book Bundle: 10% Bundle Discount on 5+ Books (Total $90, no gift)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drools/stateful/cart-evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "cartId": "CART-503",
  "customerId": "CUST-C",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PROD-BOOK-01",
      "productName": "Domain-Driven Design Reference",
      "category": "BOOKS",
      "unitPrice": 20.0,
      "quantity": 5
    }
  ]
}
